-// EG6-k (R-P1, R12-3); the shown grips are the controller's grip cache
-// (R-P9). EG7, EG8 move to Task 17 and EG9, EG10 to Task 21 (R-P8).
+// EG1-EG6, and EG7, EG8 (3a Task 17, R-P8: their door and separator), over
